# Files that steer GitHub Copilot code review or the copilot-review-gate workflow.
# Pair with the branch ruleset option "Require review from Code Owners" so a PR cannot
# weaken the [BLOCKER] rules it is reviewed under. Keep this list in sync with
# INSTRUCTION_PATHS in .github/workflows/copilot-review-gate.yml.
#
# Owners can be individual logins or a team such as @KeystoneHQ/security. GitHub silently
# ignores lines whose owner does not exist, so double-check after editing.

